{'symbol': 'HUM', 'date': '2021-11-04 11:00:00', 'title': "FOR FOURTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR, CAREPLUS HEALTH PLANS ATTAINS MEDICARE'S HIGHEST 5 OUT OF 5-STAR RATING FOR 2022", 'text': "MIAMI--(BUSINESS WIRE)--IT'S THE FIFTH TIME AND FOURTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR THAT CAREPLUS HEALTH PLANS, INC.'S MEDICARE ADVANTAGE HMO PLAN IN FLORIDA HAS ACHIEVED THE HIGHEST POSSIBLE QUALITY RATING, 5 OUT OF 5 STARS, FROM THE CENTERS FOR MEDICARE & MEDICAID SERVICES (CMS). CAREPLUS IS A SUBSIDIARY OF HUMANA INC. (NYSE: HUM). THE 5-STAR RATING RECOGNIZES THE CONTINUED EMPHASIS THE COMPANY HAS PLACED ON CREATING THE HIGHEST POSSIBLE QUALITY HEALTHCARE AND CUSTOMER SERVICE EXPERIENCE FOR ITS MEMB"}